msgid "Which roles may do what in Flurfunk. Team members see channels according to their team setting, guests according to their guest setting. Assistants always count as team. These are normal WordPress capabilities, so role editor plugins (e.g. Members or User Role Editor) can manage them as well, also for single users."
msgstr "Welche Rolle in Flurfunk was darf. Das Team sieht Kanäle nach deren Einstellung fürs Team, Gäste nach der für Gäste. Assistenten zählen immer zum Team. Es sind normale WordPress-Rechte (Capabilities), daher können Plugins zur Rollenverwaltung (z. B. Members oder User Role Editor) sie ebenso vergeben, auch an einzelne Personen."

